## Full admin surface inventory

Sourced from `src/lib/server/utils/admin-pages.ts` (ADMIN_PAGE_DEFS) and the
actual route tree under `src/routes/admin`.

### System pages (framework-owned, not tied to a MODULES key)

| Route | Current PM3 file | PM2 reference / expected behavior | Rewrite acceptance criteria |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dashboard | `admin/+page.svelte` | Stat cards grid (users/portfolios/blog/contacts counts) | Uses `PageHeader`; stats cards in responsive grid |
| Users | `admin/users/+page.svelte` | Table with role badges, add/edit modal, delete with confirm | ✅ Matched (see baseline audit) |
| Roles | `admin/roles/+page.svelte` | Role table with name/slug/level/color badges | Uses `PageHeader` + `AdminDataTable` with `Badge` |
| Translations | `admin/translations/+page.svelte` | Section toggle, locale tabs + counts, namespace accordion groups, add/edit modal, batch endpoint | ✅ Matched (see baseline audit) |
| Settings | `admin/settings/+page.svelte` | Bulk form with grouped cards, 2-col grid, contact quick picker | ✅ Matched (see baseline audit) |
| Legal | `admin/legal/+page.svelte` | Combined company details + contact gate + status grid + document editor | ✅ Matched (see baseline audit) |
| Audit | `admin/audit/+page.svelte` | Table of log entries (action/user/date) | Uses `PageHeader` + `AdminDataTable` |
| Health | `admin/health/+page.svelte` | System health check table with OK/error badges | Uses `PageHeader` + `AdminDataTable` + `Badge` |
| Security | `admin/security/+page.svelte` | Password change form + 2FA settings | Uses `PageHeader` |

### Auth and account flows

| Route | Current PM3 file | PM2 reference / expected behavior | Rewrite acceptance criteria |
|---|---|---|---|
| Login | `admin/login/+page.svelte` | Auth form with email/password + optional 2FA verify | Unchanged (not in rewrite scope) |
| Change password | `admin/change-password/+page.svelte` | Forced password change page (bootstrap hardening) | Unchanged (not in rewrite scope) |

### Website module list pages

| Route | Current PM3 file | PM2 reference / expected behavior | Rewrite acceptance criteria |
|---|---|---|---|
| Blog | `admin/blog/+page.svelte` | Card list with cover image, title, categories, tags, locale indicators | Uses `PageHeader` + card grid; `Badge` for published/draft; `EmptyState` |
| Portfolios | `admin/portfolios/+page.svelte` | Table with name/type/status + edit/delete actions | Uses `PageHeader` (w/ actions) + `AdminDataTable` |
| FAQ | `admin/faq/+page.svelte` | List with question/answer/category | Uses `PageHeader` + card list; `Badge` for published/draft |
| Features | `admin/features/+page.svelte` | Grid with title/description/icon | Uses `PageHeader` + card grid; `Badge` for published/draft |
| Pricing | `admin/pricing/+page.svelte` | List of pricing plans | Uses `PageHeader` + card list |
| Team | `admin/team/+page.svelte` | Grid with photo/name/position/social | Uses `PageHeader` + card grid; `Badge` for published/draft |
| Testimonials | `admin/testimonials/+page.svelte` | Grid with quote/author/rating | Uses `PageHeader` + card grid |
| Clients | `admin/clients/+page.svelte` | Grid with logo/name/URL | Uses `PageHeader` + card grid |
| Contacts | `admin/contacts/+page.svelte` | Contact submissions inbox — name/email/date table (module: `contact`, group: `website`) | Uses `PageHeader` + `AdminDataTable` |

### Website module create/edit pages

| Route | Current PM3 file | API backing | Rewrite acceptance criteria |
|---|---|---|---|
| Blog create | `admin/blog/create/+page.svelte` | `POST /api/admin/blog` | Uses `PageHeader` + `FormField`; SvelteKit form actions |
| Blog edit | `admin/blog/[id]/edit/+page.svelte` | `PUT /api/admin/blog/[id]` | `FormField` with pre-filled values; `EmptyState` for 404 |
| Portfolio create | `admin/portfolios/create/+page.svelte` | `POST /api/admin/portfolios` | `PageHeader` + `FormField` |
| Portfolio edit | `admin/portfolios/[id]/edit/+page.svelte` | `PUT /api/admin/portfolios/[id]` | `PageHeader` + `FormField` |
| FAQ create | `admin/faq/create/+page.svelte` | `POST /api/admin/faq` | `PageHeader` + `FormField` |
| FAQ edit | `admin/faq/[id]/edit/+page.svelte` | `PUT /api/admin/faq/[id]` | `FormField` with pre-filled values |
| Features create | `admin/features/create/+page.svelte` | `POST /api/admin/features` | `PageHeader` + `FormField` |
| Features edit | `admin/features/[id]/edit/+page.svelte` | `PUT /api/admin/features/[id]` | `FormField` with pre-filled values |
| Pricing create | `admin/pricing/create/+page.svelte` | `POST /api/admin/pricing` | `PageHeader` + `FormField` |
| Pricing edit | `admin/pricing/[id]/edit/+page.svelte` | `PUT /api/admin/pricing/[id]` | `FormField` with pre-filled values |

Team, Testimonials, and Clients have **no create/edit routes** — they are list-only pages
(entities are seeded from content.json and not editable through the admin).

