## Implementation phases

### Phase 1: AdminDataTable — visual parity with PM2 `.data-table` ✅ Matched

Implemented via `src/lib/components/admin/AdminDataTable.svelte` using PM3
design tokens and Tailwind. Column definitions accept `dataLabel`/`widthClass`.

### Phase 2: PageHeader — visual parity with PM2 `.page-header` ✅ Matched

`src/lib/components/atoms/PageHeader.svelte`: `text-3xl font-bold`, `mb-8`
bottom margin, subtitle and actions support.

### Phase 3: Translations page ✅ Matched (see baseline audit)

### Phase 4: Settings page ✅ Matched (see baseline audit)

### Phase 5: Legal page ✅ Matched (see baseline audit)

### Phase 6: Users page ✅ Matched (see baseline audit)

### Phase 7: Remaining CRUD pages — partial, only system pages completed

The system pages (dashboard, roles, audit, health, security) and the
list-level entity pages (portfolios, blog, faq, features, pricing, team,
testimonials, clients) have been retrofitted with `PageHeader` + shared
components. The create/edit form pages still use the pre-existing form patterns
(SvelteKit form actions) which are functionally correct — a full form-component
unification (canonical `FormField` atom) is future work.

### Phase 8: Admin layout content area ✅ Matched

### Phase 9: Mobile bottom nav — present in layout (line 244) ✅ Matched

Mobile bottom nav already exists in `src/routes/admin/+layout.svelte` with
`sm:hidden` responsive visibility and unread badge.

